WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,190
Do you have enough cars?

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:08,190
The truck from the factory will be delivered to you.

3
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:10,700
Just in time to pull these things

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,700
is it ok

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,700
Will it be too expensive?

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,700
It’s agreed

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,700
The materials from the factory are given to you.

8
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,700
You also helped the villagers

9
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,700
Even if I make up the difference,

10
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,700
Take it

11
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,790
You can use it. Thank you, boss.

12
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:23,790
We both drive this car

13
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:38,600
Big Boss Mr. Xiao

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,600
I didn't expect you to be here too

15
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:41,600
What a coincidence

16
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,600
Xiao Zhang and Xiao Fan are also here
